    freestanding_text_local_recompare_flips_material_admission_2026-08-10, fixing, /root/p2_29, partial, "simple_web_html_layout_renderer_core.spl:980-985 binds early material booleans and :1176-1217 uses them in admission. Ancestor 4e1d05ba67a4 repairs font-atlas reset leak. Original document retains recovered layer-3 fault chain and uncompleted rung-d; source booleans do not establish the whole five-layer/codegen/QEMU scope.", "Existing check-simpleos-wm-fullscreen-evidence.shs and archived receipts are described in the bug document; latest run stopped during native build, no current exact-producer rung-d PASS; NOT_RUN here.", "Keep all partial material/font fixes. With admitted rebuilt producer and private warm cache, reproduce remaining recovered fault/material chain in one bounded production fullscreen run; retain exact failure operation, producer/runtime identity, engine2d-glass receipt and all four captures. Repair the proven remaining owner before pending classification."
    legacy_import_string_namespace_dict_ignores_source_content_2026-08-11, fix-implemented-verification-pending, /root/p2_29, complete-source-fix, "Pure-Simple module_loader_resolve.spl:268-275 probes actual src/lib root facade after existing caller lookup. module_loader_core.spl:294-310 binds the complete module namespace to its physical owner; eval_tables.spl:338 owns namespace registration. Rust resolve_module_path_uncached in interpreter_module/path_resolution.rs:1047-1070 probes root facade before family namespace. Both source routes and focused regressions are present under ancestor 9e7e7a526edb43ab29171d920449367e5fd48127 (PR7597). src/lib/string.spl source remains authoritative, not eight hardcoded bm exports.", "test/01_unit/compiler/interpreter/full_module_source_namespace_spec.spl has four controls: exact facade selection, physical owner/bare exports, arbitrary renamed reexports and isolation, caller-local precedence. test/02_integration/compiler/interpreter/legacy_string_source_namespace_spec.spl tests exact char_at/str_char_at/char_code/str_repeat values and arbitrary facade/alias calls. Bug doc Nov5 records seed red/green and adjacent regression counts; a separate preexisting caller-local transform shadow remains independently documented. Admitted self-hosted execution NOT_RUN here.", "Execute focused source namespace controls and exact stale-eight-export reproducer with admitted redeployed self-hosted runtime; run required compiler/lib/MCP checks and native smokes. Keep unrelated caller-local transform shadow failure separate and never present source evidence as runtime PASS."
    native_primitive_to_i64_ufcs_collision_2026-07-24, fixing, /root/p2_29, partial-unproven-owner, "Recorded failsafe LogLevel.to_i64 collision is compiler native-entry/flat-HIR lowering debt, not a library method repair. method_calls_literals.spl has later provenance-gated primitive-text handling at 2801-2864, but this does not demonstrate primitive side-effecting u8 plus custom enum/trait/text/float whole scope. Bug document records multiple rejected series whose native fixture still returned code4; all candidates were removed.", "Required fixture must cover side-effecting primitive once, custom enum/trait sentinels, text Some/None, Bool/Char/high-bit unsigned and enabled backend float truncation, plus object symbol rejection. Existing retained native-cache diagnosis is historical; no current full-scope green identified and NOT_RUN here.", "Trace actual native-entry flat-HIR/MIR for probe.next_u8().to_i64 with exact admitted producer and retained per-entry artifacts before touching post-owner cast guards. Fix only resolution states proven to execute; retain custom owner dispatch and gate floats on actual backend conversion. Do not restart exhausted unchanged attempts."
    stage2_binary_vulkan_backend_init_segfault_2026-08-09, fixing, /root/p2_29, undiagnosed-producer-root, "backend_vulkan.spl VulkanBackend.create:565 and me init:879 remain real production owners. Bug describes stage2 interpreted/SFFI init segfault while seed control passed, with outdated pre-Aug9 producer; document has no proven current pure-Simple execution root. Current backend presence or later Vulkan repairs are insufficient to assert this producer failure fixed.", "Bug document has exact 64x64 init/clear/rect/readback value reproducer; historical seed VK_PROBE PASS does not qualify self-hosted producer. No exact-current-producer replay; NOT_RUN.", "Run the exact bounded Vulkan init/pixel probe on an admitted current rebuilt pure-Simple compiler and real enumerated Vulkan device, retaining producer/runtime hashes and first failing SFFI operation/backtrace. Repair the demonstrated producer/runtime owner if reproduced; do not substitute a seed or close from source-only similarity."
    iterator_collect_generic_restoration_2026-07-17, fixing, /root/p2_29, unimplemented-generic-surface, "src/compiler_rust/lib/std/src/core/traits.spl:192-205 still explicitly documents ponytail array-only compatibility and implements collect(self)->[Self.Item]. Generic C:FromIterator<Self.Item> method and C.from_iter dispatch are not restored. List/FixedVec/StaticVec FromIterator definitions alone do not implement generic Iterator.collect.", "Required native controls are array/List/FixedVec/StaticVec collection with preserved method-level generic bounds and real constrained static dispatch. No complete matching source/runtime coverage identified; NOT_RUN.", "Preserve working array ceiling. Implement method-level generic retention and constrained type-parameter static dispatch in the compiler first, then restore generic collect and prove all four collection families natively without special-case lowering; remove ceiling only with that evidence."
    notebook_cuda_exec_jit_lane_not_implemented_2026-08-08, fixing, /root/p2_29, unimplemented-per-cell-compile, "nogc_sync_mut/notebook/cuda_exec.spl:40-46 documents the gap; :134 probe returns Blocked for jit and :175 execute_cell returns an explicit error. cuda_jit_lane_executor remains fixed-vector-add, not arbitrary notebook cell source. Honest fail-closed error is implemented; requested per-cell Simple-to-PTX feature is not.", "Existing fixed-kernel executor cannot prove different cell programs compile/execute, per-cell artifact identity, arena-only sharing, and invalid-kernel rejection. No real CUDA per-cell runtime evidence; NOT_RUN.", "Implement arbitrary supplied cell-source lowering through frontend/HIR/MIR/CudaBackend, validated source-bound PTX artifact and launch owner, then wire jit CudaExec. Verify two behaviorally distinct cell programs, invalid source failure, explicit arena sharing and real CUDA device receipts before pending/full admission."
    theme_snapshot_catalog_review_hard_stop_2026-07-27, fixing, /root/p2_29, partial-authority-scope, "theme_package_wire.spl owns immutable wire and warns aggregate native ABI unverified; theme_package.spl:154-158 returns snapshot projections. Both generated aetheric_dark and fluid_light snapshots now exist, so historical single-snapshot claim is stale. Their presence does not establish reviewed authority-derived catalog/default lookup, active snapshot parity, and current-theme reauthorization on every external frame. Rejected three-candidate series remains non-admitted.", "Bug requires active nondefault snapshot authority checks, frame rejection after theme change, full tuple/alias/default/generator identity controls, and x86_64+ARM64 freestanding closure checks; no full scope accepted/runtime PASS established. NOT_RUN; no fourth unchanged retry.", "From exact current source, trace active snapshot bootstrap and every external-frame acceptance to a current installed theme identity. Preserve full nominal/wire provenance. Implement or prove both original P1 authority gaps plus catalog/default/closure scope; require independent review and admitted focused/live evidence. CtorSource remains untouched."
    wm_scene_web_lane_layout_scrambled_2026-07-03, fixing, /root/p2_29, partial-layout-fixed-residual-open, "Bug document explicitly records named geometry complaint largely resolved by rgba-aware software compositing and Metal Porter-Duff src-over. Current renderer still emits cpu-raster-backdrop-sampling-unavailable at simple_web_html_layout_renderer.spl:645. Original whole scope also retains backdrop blur, per-window CSS render/performance and structural glyph metric concerns; source-side layout fix alone does not complete it.", "Historical Chrome ground truth, rect_blend parity and scene captures are documented, but no exact-current whole-scope blur/performance/structure controls executed here. NOT_RUN; historical captures are not current qualification.", "Keep landed compositing fixes. Reproduce remaining frosted/backdrop behavior, scene structural discriminator and per-window production render latency with admitted runtime and Chrome reference. Repair each demonstrated owner while retaining scene/theme/animation invalidation, then obtain whole-scope evidence before pending classification."
